WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:20.639 --> 00:00:24.092
GRAB SUN JAE AND RUN

2
00:00:24.116 --> 00:00:26.489
EPISODE 9
Terrifying incident:

3
00:00:26.513 --> 00:00:31.329
in one of the hotels in Seoul on Ryu Seon Jae
attacked by an armed man.

4
00:00:31.429 --> 00:00:34.042
Police are searching for a runaway
from the crime scene.

5
00:00:34.066 --> 00:00:35.760
Reporter Kim speaks.

6
00:00:35.784 --> 00:00:38.278
An accident has occurred
in a five star hotel,

7
00:00:38.302 --> 00:00:40.635
not easy for outsiders to enter.

8
00:00:40.659 --> 00:00:45.391
According to the police, the criminal stole
key card from hotel staff

9
00:00:45.415 --> 00:00:49.311
and entered the room where he was
Ryu Sung Jae.

10
00:00:50.010 --> 00:00:52.783
Left at the crime scene
only weapons

11
00:00:52.807 --> 00:00:57.822
and a napkin soaked in anesthetic,
which the suspect used.

12
00:01:00.200 --> 00:01:03.253
According to those found on weapons
fingerprints

13
00:01:03.277 --> 00:01:05.810
police identified
suspect.

14
00:01:05.834 --> 00:01:09.690
Kim, 40, has a previous conviction
for murder in 2009.

15
00:01:10.150 --> 00:01:11.249
But for what?

16
00:01:11.548 --> 00:01:12.807
Why Sung Jae?

17
00:01:20.739 --> 00:01:21.838
Scissors.

18
00:01:33.487 --> 00:01:35.545
OPERATING ROOM

19
00:01:50.669 --> 00:01:52.288
I need to go back.

20
00:01:54.505 --> 00:01:56.484
BUY RYU SUN JAE WATCH

21
00:01:57.143 --> 00:02:00.879
Nothing. Maybe I have them? What if not?

22
00:02:13.526 --> 00:02:14.785
Where are they?

23
00:02:29.830 --> 00:02:33.247
Not here. Where are they? Where?

24
00:02:47.892 --> 00:02:50.070
Lim Sol. What are you doing?

25
00:02:54.525 --> 00:02:56.300
Do you know where Sun Jae's watch is?

26
00:02:56.324 --> 00:02:58.617
- What?
- He had an electronic watch.

27
00:02:58.641 --> 00:03:01.135
He wore them all through high school, remember?

28
00:03:01.159 --> 00:03:02.533
I urgently need to find them.

29
00:03:02.557 --> 00:03:04.256
What the hell is a watch?

30
00:03:04.396 --> 00:03:06.450
Who is to blame for what happened?

31
00:03:06.474 --> 00:03:09.650
- Come to your senses!
- You need a watch to get back!

32
00:03:10.070 --> 00:03:12.483
If you want to save Sun Jae, find this watch.

33
00:03:12.507 --> 00:03:15.525
How will they help us save him?

34
00:03:16.064 --> 00:03:17.323
Long story.

35
00:03:17.383 --> 00:03:21.199
So where are they? Where? Sung Jae's father?
Where does he live? Where?

36
00:03:23.057 --> 00:03:25.834
Fine. Understood. I'll look for it myself.

37
00:03:26.214 --> 00:03:28.192
You won't find them!

38
00:03:30.290 --> 00:03:31.389
What?

39
00:03:31.568 --> 00:03:33.307
He lost them a long time ago.

40
00:03:33.726 --> 00:03:36.184
Lost it a long time ago!

41
00:03:36.244 --> 00:03:38.741
Once upon a time he himself looked for them everywhere.

42
00:03:39.281 --> 00:03:40.580
And I didn’t find it.

43
00:03:41.718 --> 00:03:45.255
No... No... No... Did you find it?

44
00:03:46.154 --> 00:03:47.692
Are you serious?

45
00:03:48.232 --> 00:03:49.331
Yes.

46
00:03:50.350 --> 00:03:52.448
What's so special about this watch?

47
00:04:01.538 --> 00:04:05.630
According to the testimony of the former
cellmate Kim Young Soo...

48
00:04:05.654 --> 00:04:08.348
- Salt!
- The suspect has been carrying for a long time

49
00:04:08.372 --> 00:04:11.425
Ryu Sung Jae's revenge plan,
who became a witness

50
00:04:11.449 --> 00:04:15.061
his crimes in 2009
and handed him over to the police.

51
00:04:15.085 --> 00:04:16.739
What is he talking about?

52
00:04:16.763 --> 00:04:19.421
Wasn't the criminal captured immediately?

53
00:04:19.720 --> 00:04:22.378
How could Sun Jae meet Kim Young Soo?

54
00:04:22.438 --> 00:04:24.212
- God.
- Mother.

55
00:04:24.236 --> 00:04:27.648
Was I kidnapped in 2009?

56
00:04:27.672 --> 00:04:30.925
Yes. You just entered then
to the university.

57
00:04:30.949 --> 00:04:34.086
He wasn't imprisoned because I
moved.

58
00:04:34.585 --> 00:04:39.041
So Kim Yong Soo came for me in 2009?

59
00:04:39.181 --> 00:04:41.914
And if Sun Jae saved me that time too...

60
00:04:41.938 --> 00:04:45.670
Perhaps this is premeditated murder
for the purpose of revenge, so...

61
00:04:45.694 --> 00:04:47.672
Murder for revenge?

62
00:04:48.452 --> 00:04:49.551
Really...

63
00:04:50.370 --> 00:04:54.586
I was afraid that Kim Young Soo would try
find you when it comes out.

64
00:04:55.165 --> 00:04:57.583
I wanted to offer you
contact the police,

65
00:04:58.162 --> 00:05:00.775
but I didn’t even realize
that Yong Soo's target is Sung Jae.

66
00:05:00.799 --> 00:05:03.532
Did you bring what I asked for?

67
00:05:03.556 --> 00:05:04.815
Yes. Certainly.

68
00:05:10.230 --> 00:05:11.329
Wait.

69
00:05:13.866 --> 00:05:14.965
Yes?

70
00:05:20.380 --> 00:05:21.998
INVESTIGATION REPORT

71
00:05:25.614 --> 00:05:27.233
WRITTEN TESTIMONY OF RYU SUN JAE

72
00:05:30.809 --> 00:05:33.866
WRITTEN TESTIMONY OF RYU SUN JAE

73
00:05:41.039 --> 00:05:42.138
May 10, 2009...

74
00:05:43.397 --> 00:05:44.975
on the way home...

75
00:05:45.435 --> 00:05:47.133
I found a backpack.

76
00:05:50.070 --> 00:05:53.327
LIM SALT
The name Sol was written on the textbook.

77
00:05:53.946 --> 00:05:56.723
Then I heard her scream.

78
00:05:59.261 --> 00:06:03.037
I immediately called the police
and ran towards the noise.

79
00:06:11.329 --> 00:06:13.786
Afterwards I called Sol several times.

80
00:06:15.485 --> 00:06:19.061
There was a sound in the next building
phone call.

81
00:06:20.360 --> 00:06:22.697
I immediately ran towards the building.

82
00:06:26.474 --> 00:06:27.573
Salt!

83
00:06:27.872 --> 00:06:30.849
- Sol suddenly came out from there.
- Salt!

84
00:06:30.949 --> 00:06:33.083
- She fell to the ground.
- Salt!

85
00:06:33.107 --> 00:06:34.885
I didn't notice the man.

86
00:06:35.225 --> 00:06:36.883
- Damn it.
- Crap!

87
00:06:40.500 --> 00:06:42.877
As soon as I caught up with him,
a fight ensued.

88
00:06:43.457 --> 00:06:47.473
During this fight the man
dropped something.

89
00:06:52.088 --> 00:06:53.187
Crap!

90
00:07:14.466 --> 00:07:15.964
Die!

91
00:07:16.464 --> 00:07:18.557
- He knocked me to the floor...
- Die!

92
00:07:18.581 --> 00:07:20.440
And he began to choke.

93
00:07:20.659 --> 00:07:21.758
Die!

94
00:07:23.337 --> 00:07:27.513
I grabbed the first thing that came to hand,
and hit him on the head.

95
00:07:34.446 --> 00:07:36.064
You look better already.

96
00:07:36.484 --> 00:07:38.737
Since then you have been afraid to look at me.

97
00:07:38.761 --> 00:07:41.295
By the way, have you spoken since then?

98
00:07:41.319 --> 00:07:42.693
What the hell is a watch?

99
00:07:42.717 --> 00:07:44.815
Who is to blame for what happened?

100
00:07:50.390 --> 00:07:51.489
Song Jae...

101
00:07:52.787 --> 00:07:54.805
died because of me?

102
00:08:31.269 --> 00:08:33.926
I did everything I could.

103
00:08:34.066 --> 00:08:36.883
Why did he die anyway?

104
00:08:53.447 --> 00:08:55.465
UNDERSTANDING THE MEDIA
This...

105
00:09:00.879 --> 00:09:02.737
DETECTIVE KIM

106
00:09:04.755 --> 00:09:05.854
Hello?

107
00:09:06.154 --> 00:09:09.411
Detective Kim, I wanted to ask you something.

108
00:09:09.510 --> 00:09:13.323
There are photographs in the case file
the victim's belongings.

109
00:09:13.347 --> 00:09:16.240
Are these things stored in your precinct?

110
00:09:16.264 --> 00:09:18.002
At the station? No.

111
00:09:18.342 --> 00:09:20.000
We returned them a long time ago.

112
00:09:20.300 --> 00:09:22.797
- And what?
- Nothing.

113
00:09:30.849 --> 00:09:31.948
Maybe...

114
00:09:32.887 --> 00:09:34.426
Am I wrong?

115
00:09:47.632 --> 00:09:48.731
So...

116
00:10:14.406 --> 00:10:17.179
Salt, what is it? What's wrong with you?

117
00:10:17.203 --> 00:10:19.936
Mother! We don't have a box
with old things?

118
00:10:19.960 --> 00:10:21.415
What are you looking for?

119
00:10:21.439 --> 00:10:23.337
I... I...

120
00:10:27.872 --> 00:10:28.971
Grandma!

121
00:10:32.028 --> 00:10:33.127
This...

122
00:10:34.066 --> 00:10:37.279
Don't worry, sister, I took care of them.

123
00:10:37.303 --> 00:10:39.880
Mom, did you steal something from Sol again?

124
00:10:40.060 --> 00:10:41.718
So, come here.

125
00:10:44.296 --> 00:10:46.474
- Here.
- Grandma, wait.

126
00:10:52.887 --> 00:10:54.266
Found!

127
00:10:58.322 --> 00:11:01.259
HANGUK UNIVERSITY HOSPITAL

128
00:11:09.351 --> 00:11:11.445
How are you? Better?

129
00:11:11.469 --> 00:11:13.047
Listen, Sung Jae.

130
00:11:15.265 --> 00:11:18.601
When I see you, I remember that day.

131
00:11:20.220 --> 00:11:21.319
I'm scared.

132
00:11:21.738 --> 00:11:23.676
I can't look at you.

133
00:11:30.529 --> 00:11:32.068
Sorry, Sung Jae.

134
00:11:35.764 --> 00:11:38.022
This happened because of me.

135
00:11:38.561 --> 00:11:40.500
Now I'll change everything.

136
00:12:09.171 --> 00:12:11.549
Where am I? Back?

137
00:12:12.088 --> 00:12:13.347
Don't jump!

138
00:12:13.766 --> 00:12:15.345
What is she doing?

139
00:12:16.044 --> 00:12:18.977
- Horror!
- How did she get there?

140
00:12:19.001 --> 00:12:20.695
Careful, careful!

141
00:12:20.719 --> 00:12:23.177
In terms of? How did I end up here?

142
00:12:24.555 --> 00:12:27.253
- WELCOME TO YONSO UNIVERSITY!
- 2009...

143
00:12:27.393 --> 00:12:28.492
...year?

144
00:12:29.710 --> 00:12:31.049
Yeonseo University?!

145
00:12:31.588 --> 00:12:34.486
Salt! My God, my God!

146
00:12:38.941 --> 00:12:40.839
No, no, no!

147
00:12:44.695 --> 00:12:47.632
Is this how my life will end?

148
00:12:47.812 --> 00:12:49.391
No way!

149
00:12:49.690 --> 00:12:52.228
Even if you die, Sun Jae must be saved!

150
00:12:54.925 --> 00:12:56.823
Quiet, quiet, quiet!

151
00:12:57.642 --> 00:12:58.901
Great catch.

152
00:13:15.824 --> 00:13:17.243
Thanks a lot!

153
00:13:17.622 --> 00:13:19.241
Wow! Ryu Sung Jae?

154
00:13:22.458 --> 00:13:24.795
Sol, where are you going? Thanks again.

155
00:13:25.894 --> 00:13:29.271
It's a shame to run away like that! Wait for me!

156
00:13:31.928 --> 00:13:34.905
And should I have fallen exactly there?

157
00:13:35.844 --> 00:13:36.943
Salt!

158
00:13:37.682 --> 00:13:40.216
You didn't even say thank you to him.

159
00:13:40.240 --> 00:13:42.533
But he saved you from death.

160
00:13:42.557 --> 00:13:44.855
That's the point. Saved me again.

161
00:13:46.833 --> 00:13:48.807
What is he even doing here?

162
00:13:48.831 --> 00:13:51.688
He also studies at the Faculty of Physical Education.

163
00:13:51.748 --> 00:13:54.166
- I thought you knew.
- What?

164
00:13:54.266 --> 00:13:57.762
He was invited back at school
for an audition.

165
00:14:00.500 --> 00:14:03.273
When you go to the audition,
don't take it.

166
00:14:03.297 --> 00:14:07.073
It turns out that all this time
I wasted it.

167
00:14:09.211 --> 00:14:11.948
- It seems to me that this is fate. Maybe...
- No!

168
00:14:12.208 --> 00:14:13.786
I can't look him in the eye.

169
00:14:15.325 --> 00:14:19.740
- I'm ashamed.
- Because you left him?

170
00:14:19.960 --> 00:14:21.059
Come on!

171
00:14:21.159 --> 00:14:24.012
Just don't say you will
avoid him

172
00:14:24.036 --> 00:14:25.215
like last year!

173
00:14:25.994 --> 00:14:27.133
What remains for me?

174
00:14:27.193 --> 00:14:29.486
I'm only causing problems for him.

175
00:14:29.510 --> 00:14:34.286
Nonsense! There are so many beauties around,
he wouldn't bother with you.

176
00:14:34.346 --> 00:14:36.084
Well, that's nice.

177
00:14:39.540 --> 00:14:40.915
I'll go. I have things to do.

178
00:14:40.939 --> 00:14:42.398
Job? Wait!

179
00:14:43.297 --> 00:14:44.396
Here.

180
00:14:44.735 --> 00:14:47.233
Don't forget tomorrow.

181
00:14:49.570 --> 00:14:50.665
Stop.

182
00:14:50.689 --> 00:14:52.428
We have one more pair.

183
00:14:52.807 --> 00:14:56.743
Are you taking a walk? Shameless!
I've taken up my task again!

184
00:15:03.636 --> 00:15:05.694
MARCH 17, 2009

185
00:15:06.993 --> 00:15:09.047
TIME OF INCIDENT:
MIDNIGHT FROM 10 TO 11 MAY 2009

186
00:15:09.071 --> 00:15:11.688
We must catch Kim Young Soo before that day.

187
00:15:12.228 --> 00:15:14.526
Then Sun Jae won't get hurt.

188
00:15:16.503 --> 00:15:23.512
So, September 1, 2008 near
Was your home stolen by a taxi driver?

189
00:15:23.536 --> 00:15:26.709
- Yes.
- And why are you reporting this?

190
00:15:26.733 --> 00:15:29.866
just now, after a couple of months?
I don't understand.

191
00:15:29.890 --> 00:15:33.223
Then I was so scared
that she lost her memory.

192
00:15:33.247 --> 00:15:34.985
And now I suddenly remembered everything.

193
00:15:35.524 --> 00:15:36.743
Suddenly?

194
00:15:37.802 --> 00:15:39.421
Does this happen?

195
00:15:41.518 --> 00:15:43.057
I was kidnapped by the same man

196
00:15:43.357 --> 00:15:45.371
what is behind the incident
at the reservoir.

197
00:15:45.395 --> 00:15:48.288
- What?
- I know who the criminal is. I remembered.

198
00:15:48.312 --> 00:15:50.250
His face, name - I know everything.

199
00:15:54.705 --> 00:15:57.363
These are his keys.

200
00:15:59.660 --> 00:16:01.758
EVERYTHING FOR SELF-DEFENSE

201
00:16:05.614 --> 00:16:08.711
I told you everything I know
so he will be caught.

202
00:16:09.291 --> 00:16:10.430
Certainly.

203
00:16:14.486 --> 00:16:16.584
But still, just in case...

204
00:16:17.682 --> 00:16:19.461
you need to be able to stand up for yourself.

205
00:16:34.905 --> 00:16:37.283
Unscrupulous! Get your hands off him!

206
00:16:39.860 --> 00:16:41.039
Kim Tae Sun?

207
00:16:41.139 --> 00:16:42.238
Ex?

208
00:16:44.775 --> 00:16:46.949
- You... You...
- What is it?

209
00:16:46.973 --> 00:16:49.347
You should be ashamed! What are you doing?

210
00:16:49.371 --> 00:16:53.263
- What's wrong with you?
- She asked me to come to my senses. Did you ask?

211
00:16:53.287 --> 00:16:56.979
You're a grown man, but you're trying to squeeze out money
among schoolchildren!

212
00:16:57.003 --> 00:16:58.861
Thanks for finding it.

213
00:17:01.998 --> 00:17:04.016
Spa... Thank you?

214
00:17:06.474 --> 00:17:07.573
Give it here.

215
00:17:11.908 --> 00:17:14.086
Sorry I misunderstood.

216
00:17:20.060 --> 00:17:23.952
Who do you even take me for?
Every time it's the same.

217
00:17:23.976 --> 00:17:27.872
I'm just worried about you.
What if this is fate?

218
00:17:28.611 --> 00:17:30.470
Have you even graduated?

219
00:17:31.449 --> 00:17:34.346
So I would have immediately asked to show the photos.

220
00:17:38.082 --> 00:17:41.019
God! And he really graduated!

221
00:17:41.678 --> 00:17:42.857
What's up?

222
00:17:43.237 --> 00:17:47.453
My God. Okay, okay. What a great guy you are!
Good girl, Kim Tae Sun.

223
00:17:47.512 --> 00:17:48.767
Finally figured it out.

224
00:17:48.791 --> 00:17:50.090
What are you doing?

225
00:17:51.189 --> 00:17:52.288
That's it, I understand.

226
00:17:53.267 --> 00:17:54.366
What?

227
00:17:54.825 --> 00:17:56.444
Do I look better now?

228
00:17:56.983 --> 00:17:59.001
- What?
- You did it on purpose.

229
00:17:59.061 --> 00:18:02.238
Now I will definitely not forget this meeting.

230
00:18:02.937 --> 00:18:04.631
Now you will definitely get it.

231
00:18:04.655 --> 00:18:05.754
Wait.

232
00:18:09.850 --> 00:18:13.547
Something tells me
our aunt Sol is back.

233
00:18:14.446 --> 00:18:16.464
Yes, I'm definitely back. I feel.

234
00:18:17.922 --> 00:18:20.699
Can he see right through me?

235
00:18:22.917 --> 00:18:25.614
What? What? Why are you staring like that?

236
00:18:26.154 --> 00:18:28.168
You've gotten better. Ex.

237
00:18:28.192 --> 00:18:33.327
What a moron. Hasn't changed at all.
You have all kinds of beauties.

238
00:18:35.105 --> 00:18:37.323
So what are you doing now?

239
00:18:38.062 --> 00:18:42.238
Why am I asking? Judging by your appearance,
you drink and wander around.

240
00:18:43.137 --> 00:18:44.795
What about my appearance?

241
00:18:44.855 --> 00:18:47.593
These clothes are now -
a bestseller actually.

242
00:18:48.132 --> 00:18:49.511
Bestseller?

243
00:18:50.450 --> 00:18:51.868
- Do you sell them?
- So.

244
00:18:52.248 --> 00:18:54.426
Look for "Kim Dae Sung's Store"
on the Internet.

245
00:18:54.486 --> 00:18:56.104
KIM TAE SONG'S STORE

246
00:18:57.123 --> 00:18:59.261
What? Wow!

247
00:18:59.520 --> 00:19:02.538
Nevermind! Bad stuff.

248
00:19:02.597 --> 00:19:03.896
Shop.

249
00:19:05.355 --> 00:19:06.494
It's time for me to go.

250
00:19:10.350 --> 00:19:11.449
By the way.

251
00:19:12.348 --> 00:19:14.326
Consider the relationship established.

252
00:19:14.745 --> 00:19:15.844
See you, aunt.

253
00:19:19.181 --> 00:19:23.317
My God. Well, that's nice.
He's doing well.

254
00:19:44.795 --> 00:19:47.213
She rushed as if I were some kind of monster.

255
00:19:49.151 --> 00:19:50.450
What are you muttering there?

256
00:19:51.309 --> 00:19:53.726
What? Lim Seol ran away?

257
00:19:54.625 --> 00:19:59.081
Yes. She used to be just shy
and hid her gaze.

258
00:19:59.301 --> 00:20:01.159
And today you rushed away?

259
00:20:03.856 --> 00:20:06.749
So. And tell me what has changed?

260
00:20:06.773 --> 00:20:08.272
Everything has changed.

261
00:20:08.531 --> 00:20:11.189
I realized this as soon as
she turned around.

262
00:20:11.648 --> 00:20:13.227
I wonder what...

263
00:20:13.606 --> 00:20:15.824
did she feel at that moment?

264
00:20:16.324 --> 00:20:18.542
Her cheeks even turned a little red.

265
00:20:20.000 --> 00:20:21.099
What do you think?

266
00:20:22.158 --> 00:20:23.257
Song Jae.

267
00:20:23.317 --> 00:20:24.815
I’ll explain it for the retarded.

268
00:20:25.315 --> 00:20:28.372
She's just not interested in you.

269
00:20:28.551 --> 00:20:30.485
And she blew herself up...

270
00:20:30.509 --> 00:20:32.967
Because I suddenly got confused?

271
00:20:33.147 --> 00:20:35.844
No, she's already sick of you, you know.

272
00:20:38.142 --> 00:20:39.241
Crap!

273
00:20:39.700 --> 00:20:41.519
Move away, you're pissing me off.

274
00:20:42.458 --> 00:20:44.236
I would run away from you too!

275
00:20:44.775 --> 00:20:47.508
You were abandoned, but you still couldn’t
come to terms with -

276
00:20:47.532 --> 00:20:49.546
