285
00:21:22.458 --> 00:21:23.557
No!

286
00:21:24.256 --> 00:21:26.270
It was just raining.

287
00:21:26.294 --> 00:21:29.391
Tell me more. There hasn't been a shower for a long time.

288
00:21:29.491 --> 00:21:33.587
Jerk. Well, it will be soon.
Calm down. My God.

289
00:21:38.162 --> 00:21:41.938
You can't forget her because you
see each other all the time.

290
00:21:42.677 --> 00:21:44.855
Out of sight, out of mind.

291
00:21:46.274 --> 00:21:49.571
Forget about studying, come join our group.

292
00:21:49.710 --> 00:21:52.288
You will sing instead of Tong Seop.

293
00:21:53.147 --> 00:21:54.765
Again you are on your own.

294
00:21:55.145 --> 00:21:56.244
I'll go.

295
00:21:57.063 --> 00:21:59.041
Get it together, Sung Jae!

296
00:21:59.101 --> 00:22:02.078
Don't waste your time
to snotty texts, idiot!

297
00:22:12.328 --> 00:22:14.745
This means it’s already spring everywhere.

298
00:22:25.514 --> 00:22:29.690
It's a pity that I won't be here by the end of May.

299
00:22:30.589 --> 00:22:33.806
This is the last attempt.

300
00:23:39.321 --> 00:23:40.619
Until May 10...

301
00:23:41.079 --> 00:23:43.377
they shouldn't meet.

302
00:23:45.714 --> 00:23:47.409
At least knock!

303
00:23:47.433 --> 00:23:48.691
Knock-knock!

304
00:23:51.389 --> 00:23:52.488
Little sister.

305
00:23:52.747 --> 00:23:55.085
Sister, listen, will you give me an autograph?

306
00:23:55.145 --> 00:23:56.244
Autograph?

307
00:23:56.503 --> 00:23:57.798
What nonsense?

308
00:23:57.822 --> 00:24:00.595
Photos were posted on the university website.

309
00:24:00.619 --> 00:24:02.434
You're sleeping drunk on a statue there.

310
00:24:02.458 --> 00:24:03.752
