344
00:26:06.254 --> 00:26:07.974
SHOOTER KIM GA YOUNG CHOOSE
JONKINS CLINIC

345
00:26:08.851 --> 00:26:12.384
This clinic only deals
treatment of athletes.

346
00:26:12.408 --> 00:26:17.139
They say he somehow contacted them
famous tennis player with a shoulder injury.

347
00:26:17.163 --> 00:26:19.377
Not only is he completely
recovered,

348
00:26:19.401 --> 00:26:22.338
