can you imagine?

349
00:26:22.438 --> 00:26:25.854
These doctors also deal with gene
and cell therapy!

350
00:26:26.114 --> 00:26:28.731
I wouldn't say your chances are
are equal to zero.

351
00:26:29.271 --> 00:26:32.048
Maybe next semester
will you take a vacation?

352
00:26:33.307 --> 00:26:34.406
I need...

353
00:26:34.785 --> 00:26:36.124
think again.

354
00:26:37.862 --> 00:26:38.961
Certainly.

355
00:26:43.217 --> 00:26:45.115
Of course, think about it, think about it.

356
00:26:46.613 --> 00:26:48.072
Think about it carefully.

357
00:26:50.330 --> 00:26:51.429
Rest.

358
00:26:52.527 --> 00:26:53.626
Fine.

359
00:27:16.024 --> 00:27:17.682
EXERCISE SCIENCE TESTS

360
00:27:30.969 --> 00:27:32.787
You know what I don't like?

361
