371
00:28:23.397 --> 00:28:24.775
Here you go.

372
00:28:25.594 --> 00:28:28.048
This is the last time.
Come and take what you need.

373
00:28:28.072 --> 00:28:31.085
My case is not closed,
I can't go home!

374
00:28:31.109 --> 00:28:33.047
