406
00:30:14.206 --> 00:30:16.020
Come on, come on, come on, come on, come on.

407
00:30:16.044 --> 00:30:17.862
Rock, paper, scissors!

408
00:30:20.519 --> 00:30:21.978
Shut up!

409
00:30:22.078 --> 00:30:23.177
Guys!

410
00:30:23.437 --> 00:30:25.575
Guys, guys. The guys from Yonseo...

411
00:30:25.954 --> 00:30:27.253
did you hear?

412
00:30:27.473 --> 00:30:30.885
This legend has been passed down from generation to generation
per generation at our university.

413
00:30:30.909 --> 00:30:34.122
- A legend?
- They say who you kiss at the dedication,

414
00:30:34.146 --> 00:30:36.000
You will stay with that for the rest of your life.

415
00:30:36.024 --> 00:30:37.918
Some kind of bullshit!

416
00:30:37.942 --> 00:30:39.077
I'm answering you!

417
00:30:39.101 --> 00:30:42.553
Some senior students got married like this:
kissed at the dedication!

418
00:30:42.577 --> 00:30:46.030
And there is another married couple -
business graduates.

419
00:30:46.054 --> 00:30:49.151
They also started dating
after the dedication!

420
00:30:49.371 --> 00:30:52.064
True, I found out that a year later
they got divorced.

421
00:30:52.088 --> 00:30:56.779
But here's the thing: with the second wife
he drunkenly kissed at the dedication!

422
00:30:56.803 --> 00:30:58.018
Wow!

423
00:30:58.042 --> 00:30:59.581
And more, more, more, more.

424
00:30:59.960 --> 00:31:02.533
Once upon a time, again, at the dedication,

425
00:31:02.557 --> 00:31:06.170
