don't bother anyone! Fine?

430
00:31:17.343 --> 00:31:20.080
Let's watch our lips, okay?

431
00:31:21.778 --> 00:31:23.073
We need to be on our guard.

432
00:31:23.097 --> 00:31:25.195
You are completely safe.

433
00:31:27.732 --> 00:31:30.030
Sung Jae, do you believe this?

434
00:31:30.809 --> 00:31:32.903
You can't even call it nonsense.

435
00:31:32.927 --> 00:31:34.182
No, give it here!

436
00:31:34.206 --> 00:31:37.463
Yes, love blossoms in dedication.

437
00:31:39.481 --> 00:31:40.580
Salt.

438
00:31:41.279 --> 00:31:43.417
Yes, exactly. Listen, uh...

439
00:31:43.636 --> 00:31:46.613
How are Geum and his girlfriend doing?

440
00:31:47.433 --> 00:31:50.725
