449
00:32:15.085 --> 00:32:16.184
Spicy!

450
00:32:16.683 --> 00:32:19.141
What are you doing? I choked!

451
00:32:20.400 --> 00:32:23.652
Darling. I'm warning you.
Don't fall in love.

452
00:32:23.676 --> 00:32:27.812
Sorry, sorry, just be quiet.
I won't do it anymore.

453
00:32:37.383 --> 00:32:38.482
