467
00:33:17.742 --> 00:33:18.841
Gotcha.

468
00:33:18.981 --> 00:33:21.079
Have you already heard about the legend of Yeonseo?

469
00:33:21.379 --> 00:33:22.553
What's the matter?

470
00:33:22.577 --> 00:33:26.270
If you have any plans
blame my sister, blame yourself!

471
00:33:26.294 --> 00:33:27.828
And not a single trick!

472
00:33:27.852 --> 00:33:31.145
I've already crossed you off the list
