475
00:33:36.723 --> 00:33:41.698
Hello Hyun Joo! How spacious it is here.
Thank you for calling me!

476
00:33:42.278 --> 00:33:44.412
In terms of? Was this your idea?

477
00:33:44.436 --> 00:33:46.889
- Yes!
- Yes, so you...

478
