- She says that at that moment she forgot everything.

498
00:34:43.177 --> 00:34:44.396
Lim Sol?

499
00:34:45.814 --> 00:34:47.233
Girl, how are you?

500
00:34:47.453 --> 00:34:49.067
Where am I?

501
00:34:49.091 --> 00:34:51.269
So, on that day...

502
00:34:52.168 --> 00:34:55.700
Yes, I immediately something is wrong
