503
00:34:55.724 --> 00:34:58.537
I looked up who this Kim Yong Soo is.

504
00:34:58.561 --> 00:35:00.380
Everything agrees with the testimony.

505
00:35:00.440 --> 00:35:02.973
The girl brought the keys. Here.

506
00:35:02.997 --> 00:35:07.413
