- Yes!

519
00:35:46.354 --> 00:35:49.327
I'm a beauty with a bob from Yongseo's university -

520
00:35:49.351 --> 00:35:50.485
- Kan!
- Kan!

521
00:35:50.509 --> 00:35:51.644
- Su!
- Su!

522
00:35:51.668 --> 00:35:52.723
- Ji!
- Ji!

523
00:35:52.747 --> 00:35:55.964
Crap. How could I have thought that I could stand it?

524
00:35:59.540 --> 00:36:02.394
- Hello, hello, hello everyone!
- Yes!

525
00:36:02.418 --> 00:36:04.032
- Yeonso's first course!
- Yes!

526
00:36:04.056 --> 00:36:06.070
- Faculty of KN!
- Yes!

527
00:36:06.094 --> 00:36:09.027
