You were abandoned, but you
and could not come to terms -

786
00:54:18.442 --> 00:54:20.256
I even entered the same university!

787
00:54:20.280 --> 00:54:22.418
I would be scared too!

788
00:54:29.870 --> 00:54:31.209
Beauty.

789
00:54:34.226 --> 00:54:35.604
Maybe right now?

790
00:54:35.984 --> 00:54:38.358
- What?
- Say you miss me.

791
00:54:38.382 --> 00:54:40.639
And I'll come right away.

792
00:54:42.218 --> 00:54:43.716
Go already!

793
00:54:44.256 --> 00:54:45.435
If...

794
00:54:46.853 --> 00:54:48.991
I said I miss you

795
00:54:50.929 --> 00:54:53.427
nothing would have happened?

796
00:54:57.323 --> 00:55:00.260
Geum! Lim Geum!

797
00:55:00.839 --> 00:55:04.176
He definitely went in that direction.
Where is he?

798
00:55:08.551 --> 00:55:09.730
Geum!

799
00:55:10.909 --> 00:55:13.043
Geum! What's happened?

800
00:55:13.067 --> 00:55:15.361
What is it? Everything is fine?

801
00:55:15.385 --> 00:55:17.638
What to do? What to do?

802
00:55:17.662 --> 00:55:19.197
Chae Won...

803
00:55:19.221 --> 00:55:22.598
- Quiet!
- How could you change?

804
00:55:24.256 --> 00:55:27.153
What's good about that guy?

805
00:55:27.732 --> 00:55:29.830
Geum, did you break up?

806
00:55:31.009 --> 00:55:32.108
Is it true?

807
00:55:32.767 --> 00:55:38.022
- Did your girlfriend leave you?
- Don't leave me, Chae Won.

808
00:55:40.000 --> 00:55:41.494
Stop whining already!

809
00:55:41.518 --> 00:55:43.932
She exchanged you for someone else.

810
00:55:43.956 --> 00:55:47.528
- Chae Won...
- That's it, shut your mouth, that's enough!

811
00:55:47.552 --> 00:55:48.967
Don't you have any pride?

812
00:55:48.991 --> 00:55:50.929
My princess...

813
00:55:51.309 --> 00:55:53.163
Got it right. Which princess?

814
00:55:53.187 --> 00:55:55.604
Stop whining, stop whining!

815
00:55:55.824 --> 00:55:57.878
If you call her again...

816
00:55:57.902 --> 00:55:59.481
Chae Won...

817
00:56:06.094 --> 00:56:07.193
What?

818
00:56:34.905 --> 00:56:36.004
What?

819
00:56:37.423 --> 00:56:38.522
What?

820
00:57:02.997 --> 00:57:04.496
You'll fall.

821
00:57:06.993 --> 00:57:08.572
Why did you come?

822
00:57:10.989 --> 00:57:13.083
It's dangerous here. Get up, Sol.

823
00:57:13.107 --> 00:57:14.845
Why did you come?

824
00:57:16.903 --> 00:57:18.238
Should I have left you?

825
00:57:18.262 --> 00:57:20.196
Don't follow me!

826
00:57:20.220 --> 00:57:22.717
Why are you doing this?

827
00:57:24.176 --> 00:57:27.632
I've offended you so many times.

828
00:57:28.611 --> 00:57:30.550
Why are you worried?

829
00:57:31.249 --> 00:57:33.467
Are you a fool? Yes?

830
00:57:34.246 --> 00:57:37.423
Really a fool. You're a fool.

831
00:57:39.201 --> 00:57:43.137
She said, think only about yourself.

832
00:57:44.196 --> 00:57:47.369
Call me whatever you want
I deserve it

833
00:57:47.393 --> 00:57:50.609
but finally throw me out
out of your head!

834
00:57:51.668 --> 00:57:56.244
All this happened because of your stupidity!

835
00:57:58.462 --> 00:57:59.561
All this?

836
00:58:00.100 --> 00:58:01.279
Please...

837
00:58:02.338 --> 00:58:04.995
Please, Sung Jae, please...

838
00:58:19.281 --> 00:58:20.659
Okay, I get it.

839
00:58:21.998 --> 00:58:23.936
Sorry. For everything. Only...

840
00:58:25.594 --> 00:58:26.693
...don't cry.

841
00:58:30.390 --> 00:58:32.927
Don't notice me.

842
00:58:34.146 --> 00:58:36.484
And don't worry.

843
00:58:37.223 --> 00:58:41.319
Wherever I am, whatever I do
and no matter what happens...

844
00:58:42.657 --> 00:58:45.515
forget me, Sung Jae. Please.

845
00:59:08.831 --> 00:59:11.049
SUPERSTAR KAY

846
00:59:14.466 --> 00:59:15.565
Hello.

847
00:59:16.344 --> 00:59:17.443
How are you?

848
00:59:17.582 --> 00:59:18.681
How's the dedication?

849
00:59:21.618 --> 00:59:22.717
No way.

850
00:59:27.932 --> 00:59:31.748
Listen, Sung Jae. You wrote the song.
"Rain" or whatever it is.

851
00:59:31.848 --> 00:59:33.147
Maybe we can take part...

852
00:59:33.806 --> 00:59:34.905
in an audition?

853
00:59:37.722 --> 00:59:38.901
Don't want.

854
00:59:44.755 --> 00:59:47.533
In Hyuk, didn't you play it for anyone?

855
00:59:47.992 --> 00:59:49.526
What? To whom?

856
00:59:49.550 --> 00:59:51.648
Anyone! I'm asking.

857
00:59:51.828 --> 00:59:54.326
I heard it myself a couple of days ago.

858
00:59:54.625 --> 00:59:55.804
Who would I play it to?

859
00:59:58.222 --> 00:59:59.361
Forget.

860
00:59:59.660 --> 01:00:02.474
So here it is. Song Jae. Maybe we can take part?

861
01:00:02.498 --> 01:00:05.275
Then the whole country will hear it.
What do you say?

862
01:00:22.637 --> 01:00:23.736
What's there?

863
01:00:25.115 --> 01:00:26.454
God, my God!

864
01:00:26.633 --> 01:00:28.448
What a bastard.

865
01:00:28.472 --> 01:00:29.810
- Call!
- Now.

866
01:00:30.949 --> 01:00:32.244
God, what a freak.

867
01:00:32.268 --> 01:00:35.565
There's a fire here, come quickly.

868
01:00:35.904 --> 01:00:37.083
Yes, we are now...

869
01:00:37.263 --> 01:00:41.599
at the Juyang-ri bus stop.
Please come quickly.

870
01:00:42.218 --> 01:00:44.436
Thank you. We will be waiting for you.

871
01:00:50.689 --> 01:00:54.342
Yes. I was wondering
How is the investigation progressing?

872
01:00:54.366 --> 01:00:57.143
Fine. We are now looking for Kim Young Soo.

873
01:00:57.203 --> 01:00:59.616
Yesterday we went to a place
which you described

874
01:00:59.640 --> 01:01:00.979
but everything burned down there.

875
01:01:02.118 --> 01:01:04.336
What? Is everything burned out?

876
01:01:04.555 --> 01:01:07.688
No. This was not in the documents.

877
01:01:07.712 --> 01:01:09.850
Did he burn the evidence?

878
01:01:11.189 --> 01:01:12.807
Can't be!

879
01:01:13.187 --> 01:01:15.640
Have you found any evidence?

880
01:01:15.664 --> 01:01:16.883
Not yet.

881
01:01:17.383 --> 01:01:20.759
The suspect found out that we were looking for him.

882
01:01:29.171 --> 01:01:30.310
Maybe...

883
01:01:30.649 --> 01:01:32.308
his target is not me?

884
01:01:33.047 --> 01:01:35.265
What if he meets Sun Jae?

885
01:01:53.786 --> 01:01:55.165
Song Jae...

886
01:01:55.824 --> 01:01:57.483
I wanted to ask you something.

887
01:01:58.661 --> 01:02:01.079
- I'm in a hurry, I have to go.
- That song.

888
01:02:02.418 --> 01:02:03.756
How do you know her?

889
01:02:08.971 --> 01:02:10.070
Song?

890
01:02:10.410 --> 01:02:13.706
I only let In Hyuk listen to it. All.

891
01:02:14.006 --> 01:02:15.465
How do you know her?

892
01:02:15.804 --> 01:02:20.300
You are my most valuable gift,

893
01:02:20.559 --> 01:02:23.097
-...sent...
- I got drunk.

894
01:02:23.197 --> 01:02:24.855
...heaven.

895
01:02:25.395 --> 01:02:30.765
And in this cold world
I will protect you...

896
01:02:30.789 --> 01:02:31.888
Where did you hear...

897
01:02:33.067 --> 01:02:34.206
this song?

898
01:02:36.384 --> 01:02:38.482
This time I'll change everything.

899
01:02:39.461 --> 01:02:42.518
Before you go back.

900
01:02:43.417 --> 01:02:44.516
Where are you...

901
01:02:47.173 --> 01:02:48.272
To the future.

902
01:02:49.411 --> 01:02:50.829
In due time.

903
01:02:58.082 --> 01:02:59.221
Where are you going?

904
01:03:03.277 --> 01:03:05.455
- I...
-Are you running away on time?

905
01:03:14.346 --> 01:03:15.445
Who are you?

906
01:03:18.142 --> 01:03:19.241
Are you really...

907
01:03:21.898 --> 01:03:22.997
from the future?

908
01:03:41.558 --> 01:03:43.457
Let's go. Get in.

909
01:03:53.706 --> 01:03:54.965
Get in.

910
01:04:28.472 --> 01:04:31.529
GRAB SUN JAE AND RUN

911
01:04:31.588 --> 01:04:34.761
What if you liked it
girl from the future?

912
01:04:34.785 --> 01:04:36.879
I wouldn't take no for an answer!

913
01:04:36.903 --> 01:04:38.522
Hello, hello!

914
01:04:38.661 --> 01:04:40.555
Look at her. Fell in love.

915
01:04:40.579 --> 01:04:41.914
Sun Jae, let's date.

916
01:04:41.938 --> 01:04:44.915
I like you. I like you!

917
01:04:46.054 --> 01:04:50.066
Don't take your anger out on me.
Take care of your health.

918
01:04:50.090 --> 01:04:51.589
Last question.

919
01:04:51.728 --> 01:04:55.025
And in no time where you found yourself,
Didn't you like me?

920
01:04:55.125 --> 01:04:56.544
No. None.

921
01:04:56.603 --> 01:04:58.582
Then I'll leave so as not to interfere.

922
01:04:59.161 --> 01:05:02.018
Don't come near. Don't come near, I say!

923
01:05:02.797 --> 01:05:05.650
Translated and voiced by the studio
"Mobile TV"

924
01:05:05.674 --> 01:05:09.051
commissioned by the online cinema Ivy
in 2024.

